script = ExtResource("1")

; The circle is inset by ATOM_INSET (10px) inside a Control that stays 72x72,
; leaving a margin for atom.gd to draw the Lewis valence dots around it.
;
; The Control is deliberately NOT enlarged to make that room: main.gd's cluster
; detection bonds atoms whose rects overlap after `grow(-16)`, so a bigger rect
; would quietly change how close two atoms must be to react. Shrinking the
; circle instead leaves the bonding distance exactly as it was playtested.

